      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING INTENTION (8) won again and recorded an impressive time after leading them home to bring up five wins in a row, scoring at Shepparton over 390m (22.05). Has won two of two starts from this draw. Hard to go past. MOTHER GEORGIA (7) was below best at her last start when 7th at this track following a win (22.00) at Ballarat two back. A big run wouldn't surprise. BAROOGA KING (1) has a strong record this trip with nine wins and eight placings from 27 starts. Hit the frame latest (22.23) when third at this track in a Grade 4/5. Looks suited here and can measure up. LEKTRA JIMMY (3) surprised many when in the placings last start - deserves some thought.",
